XIO COMPILER DRIVER

INPUT
    *.xio

OPTIONS
    --target x86_64
    --target aarch64
    --emit tokens
    --emit ast
    --emit ir
    --emit asm
    --emit obj
    --emit elf
    --freestanding
    --kernel
    --no-link

PIPELINE
    load
    lex
    parse
    resolve
    semantic
    lower
    optimize
    codegen
    assemble
    object
    link

VALIDATION
    source valid
    target valid
    IR valid
    machine code valid
    object valid
    ELF valid

ERROR
    never execute invalid output
